{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 4470 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for our cefuroxime product names HIKMA FARMACEUTICA (PORTUGAL), S.A. as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3002807173).",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 876911 of that plant ended on 2014-03-28 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI) with six observations including absence of written procedures and deviations from laboratory control requirements.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was subsequently issued to the plant on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification occurred 4470 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2015, 2016, 2020, and 2023 were classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI).",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory shows Corvale East has 11 days on hand and Corvale General has 26 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to buy from B. Braun Medical Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
